    "title": "ButterflyMX",
    "description": "ButterflyMX allows you to open and manage doors & gates from your smartphone. Once our video intercom, keypad, elevator controls, package room, or key locker have been installed at your property, downloading this app will provide you with features such as video calling, virtual keys, delivery PINs, remote access, and much more - all designed to make property access simple for staff, residents, visitors, and deliveries. What\u2019s more, all entries are recorded with a date- and time-stamped photo available for review in both the mobile app and on the property management dashboard.\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve designed our software and hardware to be secure, convenient, and affordable. If you would like to learn how ButterflyMX can transform property access at your building, visit: www.butterflymx.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "ButterflyMX allows you to open and manage doors &amp; gates from your smartphone. Once our video intercom, keypad, elevator controls, package room, or key locker have been installed at your property, downloading this app will provide you with features such as video calling, virtual keys, delivery PINs, remote access, and much more - all designed to make property access simple for staff, residents, visitors, and deliveries. What\u2019s more, all entries are recorded with a date- and time-stamped photo available for review in both the mobile app and on the property management dashboard.<br><br>We\u2019ve designed our software and hardware to be secure, convenient, and affordable. If you would like to learn how ButterflyMX can transform property access at your building, visit: www.butterflymx.com",
